# Build context is services/: keep this service and the shared package only.
# (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile.) Unlike
# the executor image, this one keeps the Keras model: training starts from it.
*
!common/
!executor/
common/tests/
common/*.egg-info/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
executor/venv*/
executor/tmp_*/
executor/tests/
executor/images/
executor/test.py
executor/requirements.old.txt
executor/README.md
executor/Dockerfile*
executor/models/
